<section id="about" class="bg-slate-50 py-20 text-slate-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          Craftsmanship shaped by thoughtful design.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
          DigitalWoodworker combines material knowledge, modern techniques,a blend of precision machinery and fine hand tools and tailored communication to craft intricate wooden art that bring your story to life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-slate-400">Tailored Materials</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">I source premium hardwoods and match species to each commission for beautiful durability.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-slate-400">Transparent Process</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">From first concept through finish, you receive updates at every stage of production.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-slate-400">Elegant & Timeless</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Uncompromising Detail, Unmatched Finish</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">True quality doesn't hide. Every design is crafted for perfection from the inside out.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-slate-400">Thoughtful Finish</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Finishes are selected to bring out wood tone, texture, and long-term resilience. Select from a wide variety of finishes from food safe homemade beeswax-coconut oil to imported hardwax oil.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
